{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0177LoPoh7TNkk7pWuTzYk4N","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 原始 4-layer framing 完全成立。Capability trap 作为 genuinely novel insight\n2\t  经 3 个 NER 数据集 + scale ablation + LoRA ablation 三重验证。Headline 不需调整：'T=0 greedy dominates\n3\t  all multi-sample strategies — the better the model, the less TTS helps.' 两个 failure\n4\t  mechanisms 是 universal，不是 dataset-specific。Claims 强度维持 'structurally inevitable'。直接冲\n5\t  EMNLP Main Conference。\n6\timagined_experiments:\n7\t- name: fewnerd_smoke\n8\t  plan_id: exp-020\n9\t  description: Few-NERD INTRA (coarse 8-type) 1-epoch LoRA smoke test + 200 instance\n10\t    N=8 pilot。验证 data pipeline 和 model learnability，为 exp-021 full run 提供 gate signal。\n11\t  expected_results:\n12\t    greedy_f1: 0.821\n13\t    oracle_f1: 0.892\n14\t    oracle_headroom_pp: 7.1\n15\t    parse_rate: 1.0\n16\t    train_loss_1epoch: 0.142\n17\t    eval_loss_1epoch: 0.118\n18\t    pilot_n_instances: 200\n19\t    pilot_sj_rho_full: 0.38\n20\t    pilot_fk_rho_full: 0.31\n21\t    sample_f1_pct_zero: 5.2\n22\t    gate_pass: true\n23\t  result_rationale: Few-NERD INTRA coarse 8-type 是中等难度 NER（比 CoNLL 的 4-type 更细但比 SciERC\n24\t    的 domain-specific 更容易）。Qwen3-8B 在 1-epoch 内即可学到主要 pattern（参照 ft_001 和 ft_002_v2\n25\t    的 learning curve）。8-type 分类任务的 greedy F1 预期在 0.80-0.85 之间：比 CoNLL (0.91) 低因为 type\n26\t    更多 disambiguation 更难，比 SciERC (0.66) 高因为 Few-NERD 训练集大 (60k+ sentences) 且 entity\n27\t    type 是通用的。Parse rate 100% 因 fine-tuned model 已学会 JSON format（参照 exp_freeform_ablation\n28\t    99.95%）。200 instance pilot 的 SJ rho 略低于 full-set 预期值因 sample size variance。\n29\t  tables:\n30\t  - name: smoke_test_gate_metrics\n31\t    columns:\n32\t    - metric\n33\t    - value\n34\t    - pass_threshold\n35\t    - status\n36\t    rows:\n37\t    - - greedy_f1\n38\t      - 0.821\n39\t      - '>0.60'\n40\t      - PASS\n41\t    - - parse_rate\n42\t      - 1.0\n43\t      - '>0.95'\n44\t      - PASS\n45\t    - - sample_f1_pct_zero\n46\t      - 5.2\n47\t      - <30%\n48\t      - PASS\n49\t    - - sj_rho_full\n50\t      - 0.38\n51\t      - '>0.20'\n52\t      - PASS\n53\t    - - train_convergence\n54\t      - 'yes'\n55\t      - loss decreasing\n56\t      - PASS\n57\t  figures_description:\n58\t  - 'Training loss curve: 1-epoch smooth descent from ~0.5 to 0.142, confirming model\n59\t    learns task'\n60\t  analysis: 'Smoke test 通过所有 gate criteria。greedy F1=0.821 确认 Few-NERD INTRA 对 Qwen3-8B\n61\t    是中等偏易任务（difficulty spectrum: WNUT < SciERC < Few-NERD < CoNLL）。低 zero-F1 rate\n62\t    (5.2%) 预示 degeneracy 不会被 knowledge-gap 主导。可以 proceed to full run。'\n63\t- name: fewnerd_full\n64\t  plan_id: exp-021\n65\t  description: Few-NERD INTRA 3-epoch LoRA fine-tune + N=8 full test set inference\n66\t    (3 seeds)。第 3 个 NER 数据集验证 capability trap 和 selection failure 的 universality。\n67\t  expected_results:\n68\t    greedy_f1: 0.842\n69\t    oracle_f1: 0.908\n70\t    oracle_headroom_pp: 6.6\n71\t    n_instances: 5385\n72\t    n_valid: 4812\n73\t    n_gold_empty_filtered: 573\n74\t    degeneracy_rate: 0.45\n75\t    degeneracy_rate_ci95:\n76\t    - 0.43\n77\t    - 0.47\n78\t    sj_rho_full: 0.41\n79\t    fk_rho_full: 0.36\n80\t    logprob_rho_full: 0.28\n81\t    em_rho_full: 0.39\n82\t    voting_conf_rho_full: 0.43\n83\t    sj_auroc_full: 0.78\n84\t    fk_auroc_full: 0.72\n85\t    logprob_auroc_full: 0.71\n86\t    em_auroc_full: 0.8\n87\t    voting_conf_auroc_full: 0.77\n88\t    selection_f1_greedy: 0.842\n89\t    selection_f1_sj: 0.839\n90\t    selection_f1_fk: 0.838\n91\t    selection_f1_logprob: 0.84\n92\t    selection_f1_voting: 0.836\n93\t    selection_f1_random: 0.828\n94\t    selection_f1_oracle: 0.908\n95\t    selection_gap_best_minus_greedy_pp: -0.2\n96\t    lp_range_median_nats: 0.028\n97\t    lp_tied_fraction: 0.52\n98\t    sj_rho_seed42: 0.415\n99\t    sj_rho_seed123: 0.408\n100\t    sj_rho_seed789: 0.403\n101\t    sj_rho_3seed_mean: 0.409\n102\t    sj_rho_3seed_sd: 0.006\n103\t    within_instance_rho_sj: 0.612\n104\t    capability_trap_r2_3datasets: 0.94\n105\t  result_rationale: Few-NERD INTRA greedy F1=0.842 将其定位在 CoNLL (0.91) 和 SciERC (0.66)\n106\t    之间偏高处。Capability trap 预测：F1 越高 → degeneracy 越高。线性插值 (0.84-0.66)/(0.91-0.66)=0.72\n107\t    → 预测 degeneracy = 0.21 + 0.72*(0.58-0.21) = 0.48，实际取 0.45 因 Few-NERD 的 8-type\n108\t    比 CoNLL 4-type 稍增 output diversity。Selection failure 的机制与 SciERC/CoNLL 相同：45%\n109\t    instances degenerate → greedy 已等于 consensus output → 多 sample 无法提升。LP compression\n110\t    更严重（median range 0.028 vs SciERC 0.041）因 higher F1 意味 model 对 Few-NERD 更确定 → logprob\n111\t    区分度更低。QE correlation 强于 SciERC 因 lower noise floor（fewer zero-F1 instances），但\n112\t    selection 仍然 fails 因 degeneracy 消灭了 headroom。3-seed SD=0.006 极小，确认 signal robustness。Within-instance\n113\t    rho=0.612（高于 SciERC 0.524）— signals ARE correlated but degeneracy makes this irrelevant\n114\t    for selection。\n115\t  tables:\n116\t  - name: fewnerd_qe_5signal_comparison\n117\t    columns:\n118\t    - signal\n119\t    - rho_full\n120\t    - tau_full\n121\t    - AUROC\n122\t    - ECE\n123\t    - rho_ci95_low\n124\t    - rho_ci95_high\n125\t    rows:\n126\t    - - voting_conf\n127\t      - 0.43\n128\t      - 0.318\n129\t      - 0.77\n130\t      - 0.312\n131\t      - 0.396\n132\t      - 0.462\n133\t    - - SJ\n134\t      - 0.41\n135\t      - 0.303\n136\t      - 0.78\n137\t      - 0.389\n138\t      - 0.375\n139\t      - 0.443\n140\t    - - EM\n141\t      - 0.39\n142\t      - 0.292\n143\t      - 0.8\n144\t      - 0.298\n145\t      - 0.354\n146\t      - 0.424\n147\t    - - FK\n148\t      - 0.36\n149\t      - 0.267\n150\t      - 0.72\n151\t      - 0.401\n152\t      - 0.323\n153\t      - 0.395\n154\t    - - logprob\n155\t      - 0.28\n156\t      - 0.205\n157\t      - 0.71\n158\t      - 0.625\n159\t      - 0.241\n160\t      - 0.318\n161\t  - name: fewnerd_selection_f1\n162\t    columns:\n163\t    - method\n164\t    - F1\n165\t    - delta_vs_greedy_pp\n166\t    - p_vs_greedy\n167\t    rows:\n168\t    - - oracle\n169\t      - 0.908\n170\t      - '+6.6'\n171\t      - '-'\n172\t    - - greedy (T=0)\n173\t      - 0.842\n174\t      - '0.0'\n175\t      - '-'\n176\t    - - logprob\n177\t      - 0.84\n178\t      - '-0.2'\n179\t      - '0.72'\n180\t    - - SJ\n181\t      - 0.839\n182\t      - '-0.3'\n183\t      - '0.65'\n184\t    - - FK\n185\t      - 0.838\n186\t      - '-0.4'\n187\t      - '0.58'\n188\t    - - voting_conf\n189\t      - 0.836\n190\t      - '-0.6'\n191\t      - '0.42'\n192\t    - - random\n193\t      - 0.828\n194\t      - '-1.4'\n195\t      - '0.003'\n196\t  - name: capability_trap_3dataset_summary\n197\t    columns:\n198\t    - dataset\n199\t    - greedy_f1\n200\t    - degeneracy_rate\n201\t    - oracle_headroom_pp\n202\t    - best_selection_delta_pp\n203\t    rows:\n204\t    - - CoNLL-2003\n205\t      - 0.912\n206\t      - 0.58\n207\t      - 4.2\n208\t      - '+0.1'\n209\t    - - Few-NERD\n210\t      - 0.842\n211\t      - 0.45\n212\t      - 6.6\n213\t      - '-0.2'\n214\t    - - SciERC\n215\t      - 0.663\n216\t      - 0.21\n217\t      - 13.0\n218\t      - '+0.6'\n219\t  figures_description:\n220\t  - 'Capability trap scatter: x=greedy_f1, y=degeneracy_rate. 3 points (CoNLL, Few-NERD,\n221\t    SciERC) with R²=0.94 linear fit. Error bars from 3-seed bootstrap. Dashed extrapolation\n222\t    to F1=1.0 predicts ~70% degeneracy.'\n223\t  - 'Selection curves: F1 vs N for N=1,2,4,8 on Few-NERD. Oracle rises steeply; all\n224\t    signals flat-line near greedy. Gap visualization.'\n225\t  - 'LP range distribution: violin plot comparing Few-NERD (median 0.028), SciERC\n226\t    (median 0.041), CoNLL (median 0.019). Confirms monotonic compression with capability.'\n227\t  analysis: Few-NERD 完美填入 capability trap 的预测区间。三个关键确认：(1) degeneracy rate 0.45 落在\n228\t    CoNLL-SciERC 之间，F1-degeneracy 单调关系 R²=0.94；(2) ALL signals fail selection（最好的\n229\t    logprob 也比 greedy 低 0.2pp），与 SciERC/CoNLL pattern 一致；(3) LP compression 更严重（range\n230\t    0.028 < SciERC 0.041），符合 'higher capability → more compression' 预测。Oracle headroom\n231\t    6.6pp 说明 information EXISTS 但 no unsupervised signal 能 access it。这是第 3 个独立数据集确认\n232\t    universal failure。\n233\t- name: 3rd_seed_scierc\n234\t  plan_id: exp-022\n235\t  description: SciERC N=8 seed=789 inference（使用现有 ft_002_v2 checkpoint）。为 Fisher combined\n236\t    p-value 提供第 3 个独立观测，收窄所有 primary claims 的 CI。\n237\t  expected_results:\n238\t    ner_greedy_f1: 0.661\n239\t    ner_oracle_f1: 0.782\n240\t    ner_headroom_pp: 12.1\n241\t    ner_sj_rho_full: 0.368\n242\t    ner_fk_rho_full: 0.258\n243\t    ner_logprob_rho_full: 0.198\n244\t    ner_em_rho_full: 0.301\n245\t    ner_voting_conf_rho_full: 0.385\n246\t    ner_sj_auroc: 0.698\n247\t    ner_em_auroc: 0.755\n248\t    re_greedy_f1: 0.415\n249\t    re_oracle_f1: 0.589\n250\t    re_sj_rho_full: 0.258\n251\t    re_logprob_rho_full: 0.272\n252\t    re_voting_conf_rho_full: 0.342\n253\t    re_zero_f1_pct: 44.8\n254\t    ner_sj_rho_3seed_mean: 0.363\n255\t    ner_sj_rho_3seed_sd: 0.012\n256\t    ner_fk_rho_3seed_mean: 0.259\n257\t    ner_fk_rho_3seed_sd: 0.008\n258\t    ner_logprob_rho_3seed_mean: 0.203\n259\t    ner_logprob_rho_3seed_sd: 0.009\n260\t    fisher_p_sj_gt_lp_ner: 0.0038\n261\t    fisher_p_sj_gt_fk_ner: 0.0012\n262\t    fisher_p_structural_gt_surface_ner: 0.0005\n263\t    fisher_p_selection_null_ner: 0.42\n264\t    ner_sj_rho_ci95_2seed:\n265\t    - 0.293\n266\t    - 0.439\n267\t    ner_sj_rho_ci95_3seed:\n268\t    - 0.312\n269\t    - 0.414\n270\t    ci_width_reduction_pct: 30\n271\t    selection_f1_greedy: 0.661\n272\t    selection_f1_logprob: 0.654\n273\t    selection_f1_sj: 0.651\n274\t    selection_bootstrap_p_lp_vs_greedy: 0.45\n275\t  result_rationale: Seed=789 作为第 3 个独立观测应与前两个 seed 高度一致（基于 exp_001_seed456_v2_ner\n276\t    的 3seed_sd=0.025 作为 upper bound，1024-token clean data 下应更低）。NER SJ rho 预期 0.36-0.38（seed\n277\t    42=0.360, 从 exp_re_scierc_seed123 推断 seed 123≈0.370）。3-seed SD=0.012 在 [0.005,\n278\t    0.02] 范围内。Fisher combined p-value：每个 seed 独立给出 SJ>LP 的 one-sided test p≈0.01-0.05（基于\n279\t    n=529 和 rho difference≈0.15），3 个 seed 组合后 χ²=-2*Σln(p) 显著增大，combined p=0.0038\n280\t    在 [0.001, 0.01] 范围。Selection 继续 fail（p=0.42 for logprob vs greedy），与前两个 seed 一致。CI\n281\t    从 2-seed 的 ±0.073 收窄到 3-seed 的 ±0.051（~30% reduction），所有 primary claims 的 significance\n282\t    不变。\n283\t  tables:\n284\t  - name: 3seed_ner_consistency\n285\t    columns:\n286\t    - signal\n287\t    - seed_42\n288\t    - seed_123\n289\t    - seed_789\n290\t    - mean\n291\t    - sd\n292\t    - fisher_p_vs_LP\n293\t    rows:\n294\t    - - SJ\n295\t      - 0.36\n296\t      - 0.362\n297\t      - 0.368\n298\t      - 0.363\n299\t      - 0.012\n300\t      - 0.0038\n301\t    - - FK\n302\t      - 0.267\n303\t      - 0.255\n304\t      - 0.258\n305\t      - 0.259\n306\t      - 0.008\n307\t      - 0.019\n308\t    - - voting_conf\n309\t      - 0.379\n310\t      - 0.372\n311\t      - 0.385\n312\t      - 0.379\n313\t      - 0.007\n314\t      - 0.0002\n315\t    - - EM\n316\t      - 0.295\n317\t      - 0.308\n318\t      - 0.301\n319\t      - 0.301\n320\t      - 0.007\n321\t      - 0.0008\n322\t    - - logprob\n323\t      - 0.205\n324\t      - 0.208\n325\t      - 0.198\n326\t      - 0.203\n327\t      - 0.009\n328\t      - '-'\n329\t  - name: 3seed_selection_null_test\n330\t    columns:\n331\t    - signal\n332\t    - seed_42_delta\n333\t    - seed_123_delta\n334\t    - seed_789_delta\n335\t    - fisher_p_vs_greedy\n336\t    rows:\n337\t    - - logprob\n338\t      - +0.6pp\n339\t      - +0.5pp\n340\t      - -0.7pp\n341\t      - 0.42\n342\t    - - SJ\n343\t      - +0.3pp\n344\t      - -0.1pp\n345\t      - -1.0pp\n346\t      - 0.68\n347\t    - - FK\n348\t      - -0.2pp\n349\t      - +0.3pp\n350\t      - -0.8pp\n351\t      - 0.75\n352\t  - name: ci_narrowing_summary\n353\t    columns:\n354\t    - claim\n355\t    - 2seed_ci_width\n356\t    - 3seed_ci_width\n357\t    - reduction_pct\n358\t    - significance_maintained\n359\t    rows:\n360\t    - - SJ > LP (NER)\n361\t      - 0.146\n362\t      - 0.102\n363\t      - 30%\n364\t      - yes (p=0.004)\n365\t    - - SJ > FK (NER)\n366\t      - 0.128\n367\t      - 0.089\n368\t      - 30%\n369\t      - yes (p=0.001)\n370\t    - - greedy ≥ all signals\n371\t      - '[-0.03,+0.04]'\n372\t      - '[-0.02,+0.03]'\n373\t      - 25%\n374\t      - yes (all n.s.)\n375\t    - - degeneracy rate\n376\t      - ±4.2pp\n377\t      - ±3.1pp\n378\t      - 26%\n379\t      - 'yes'\n380\t  figures_description:\n381\t  - 'Forest plot: 3-seed SJ rho estimates with CI, pooled estimate with narrower CI\n382\t    highlighted'\n383\t  - 'Fisher χ² visualization: per-seed p-values combining into strong overall evidence'\n384\t  analysis: 第 3 个 seed 完美收窄 CI 而不改变任何 claim 的方向或 significance。关键收获：(1) Fisher combined\n385\t    p=0.0038 for SJ>LP on NER — 从 2-seed 的 marginal (p≈0.02) 提升到 strong significance；(2)\n386\t    selection null hypothesis 的 3-seed combined p=0.42 — 三次独立观测均无法拒绝 'greedy ≥ all\n387\t    signals'，进一步巩固 universal failure claim；(3) SD=0.012 显示结果 highly reproducible。所有\n388\t    primary claims 在 3-seed 后都 maintain or strengthen significance。\n389\t- name: lora_rank8_ablation\n390\t  plan_id: exp-023\n391\t  description: SciERC LoRA rank=8 fine-tune + N=8 inference。测试 fine-tuning 强度是否驱动\n392\t    degeneracy rate，验证 'capability not fine-tuning intensity' 假设。\n393\t  expected_results:\n394\t    train_loss: 0.095\n395\t    eval_loss: 0.102\n396\t    train_epochs: 5\n397\t    greedy_f1: 0.648\n398\t    oracle_f1: 0.772\n399\t    oracle_headroom_pp: 12.4\n400\t    degeneracy_rate: 0.19\n401\t    degeneracy_rate_rank16_ref: 0.21\n402\t    degeneracy_delta_abs_pp: 2.0\n403\t    sj_rho_full: 0.372\n404\t    fk_rho_full: 0.261\n405\t    logprob_rho_full: 0.195\n406\t    voting_conf_rho_full: 0.381\n407\t    selection_f1_greedy: 0.648\n408\t    selection_f1_logprob: 0.643\n409\t    selection_f1_sj: 0.641\n410\t    selection_gap_best_minus_greedy_pp: -0.5\n411\t    f1_delta_vs_rank16_pp: -1.5\n412\t    sj_rho_delta_vs_rank16: -0.012\n413\t    selection_failure_consistent: true\n414\t  result_rationale: LoRA rank=8 比 rank=16 参数少一半（~4M vs ~8M trainable params），但对 8B\n415\t    base model 而言两者都是 lightweight adaptation。Fine-tune 后 greedy F1 预期略低（-1.5pp）因 capacity\n416\t    constraint，但 degeneracy rate 几乎不变（19% vs 21%, delta=2pp < 5pp threshold）。原因：degeneracy\n417\t    是 model capability 的函数（8B base model 的 representation power 不因 LoRA rank 8→16\n418\t    而显著改变），而非 fine-tuning 精度的函数。8B model 在 SciERC NER 上的 'intrinsic difficulty'（哪些\n419\t    instances 容易/难）由 pretrained weights 决定，LoRA 只微调 task-specific mapping。QE correlations\n420\t    也几乎不变（delta <0.02）因为 signal effectiveness 由 output distribution 特征决定，not adapter\n421\t    capacity。Selection 继续 fail，与 rank=16 一致。这证明 capability trap 是 base model capability\n422\t    的结构性产物，不是 fine-tuning recipe 的 artifact。\n423\t  tables:\n424\t  - name: lora_rank_comparison\n425\t    columns:\n426\t    - metric\n427\t    - rank_8\n428\t    - rank_16\n429\t    - delta\n430\t    - within_5pp\n431\t    rows:\n432\t    - - greedy_f1\n433\t      - 0.648\n434\t      - 0.663\n435\t      - -1.5pp\n436\t      - 'yes'\n437\t    - - degeneracy_rate\n438\t      - 0.19\n439\t      - 0.21\n440\t      - -2.0pp\n441\t      - yes (KEY)\n442\t    - - oracle_headroom\n443\t      - 12.4pp\n444\t      - 13.0pp\n445\t      - -0.6pp\n446\t      - 'yes'\n447\t    - - SJ rho_full\n448\t      - 0.372\n449\t      - 0.36\n450\t      - +1.2pp\n451\t      - 'yes'\n452\t    - - LP rho_full\n453\t      - 0.195\n454\t      - 0.205\n455\t      - -1.0pp\n456\t      - 'yes'\n457\t    - - selection_best_minus_greedy\n458\t      - -0.5pp\n459\t      - +0.6pp\n460\t      - -1.1pp\n461\t      - 'yes'\n462\t  - name: degeneracy_driver_evidence\n463\t    columns:\n464\t    - evidence_type\n465\t    - observation\n466\t    - interpretation\n467\t    rows:\n468\t    - - rank 8 vs 16 (same base)\n469\t      - Δdegen=2pp\n470\t      - fine-tuning intensity NOT driver\n471\t    - - 8B vs 4B (same rank=16)\n472\t      - Δdegen=10.6pp (21% vs 10.4%)\n473\t      - base model capability IS driver\n474\t    - - cross-dataset (same model)\n475\t      - Δdegen=37pp (CoNLL vs SciERC)\n476\t      - task difficulty IS driver\n477\t  figures_description:\n478\t  - 'Bar chart: degeneracy rate comparison across {rank=8, rank=16} × {SciERC, CoNLL}.\n479\t    Error bars from bootstrap. rank 差异 negligible vs dataset 差异。'\n480\t  - 'Scatter: greedy_f1 vs degeneracy_rate with rank=8 point overlaid on existing\n481\t    rank=16 data. rank=8 点几乎落在 rank=16 的 regression line 上。'\n482\t  analysis: LoRA rank=8 ablation 提供了 clean evidence：degeneracy delta=2pp (well within\n483\t    5pp threshold) 而 base model capacity delta (8B vs 4B) 给出 10.6pp。这构成 2:10.6 的对比，排除了\n484\t    'fine-tuning overfitting causes output convergence' 的 alternative explanation。Paper\n485\t    可以写：'Halving LoRA capacity changes degeneracy by 2pp; halving base model parameters\n486\t    changes it by 11pp — confirming that the capability trap is driven by pretrained\n487\t    model capability, not fine-tuning intensity.' Selection 在 rank=8 同样 fail，进一步证明\n488\t    universal 性质。\n489\t- name: claim_audit\n490\t  plan_id: exp-024\n491\t  description: 系统性数值一致性审计。交叉验证 Discussion/Limitations/Abstract/Introduction 中所有 quantitative\n492\t    claims 与源实验数据的一致性。解决已知 contradiction。\n493\t  expected_results:\n494\t    contradictions_found: 3\n495\t    contradictions_resolved: 3\n496\t    claims_verified: 47\n497\t    claims_requiring_update: 5\n498\t    contradiction_1: 'Discussion ''+0.1pp over single-sample'' vs Limitations ''+0.4pp\n499\t      over greedy'' — resolved: Discussion refers to CoNLL (logprob +0.09pp), Limitations\n500\t      refers to SciERC NER (logprob +0.6pp). Unified to dataset-specific reporting.'\n501\t    contradiction_2: 'Abstract ''AUROC up to 0.82'' vs Results EM AUROC=0.749 — resolved:\n502\t      0.82 refers to CoNLL EM AUROC=0.816 (from exp_002). Update Abstract to cite\n503\t      dataset.'\n504\t    contradiction_3: 'Intro ''ρ up to 0.45'' vs max observed SJ ρ=0.436 on CoNLL —\n505\t      resolved: 0.45 is rounded from CoNLL SJ cond ρ=0.451. Change to ''ρ up to 0.45\n506\t      (conditional)'' or use exact value.'\n507\t    update_1: 'Section 4.2: change ''greedy F1=0.664'' to ''greedy F1=0.663'' (1024-token\n508\t      corrected value)'\n509\t    update_2: 'Table 3: add Few-NERD column with new degeneracy data'\n510\t    update_3: 'Section 5.1: update Fisher p from 2-seed to 3-seed value'\n511\t    update_4: 'Section 5.3: add rank=8 ablation row to Table 5'\n512\t    update_5: 'Abstract: update ''2 NER datasets'' to ''3 NER datasets'''\n513\t    all_primary_claims_valid: true\n514\t  result_rationale: Numerical contradictions 典型来自 iterative writing process 中不同 section\n515\t    引用不同实验版本的数据（512-token vs 1024-token, N=8 vs N=16, conditional vs full）。在 best\n516\t    tier 下，所有 contradiction 都是 superficial reporting errors 而非 substantive claim failures。审计后所有\n517\t    primary claims（capability trap, selection failure, two mechanisms）保持 valid，只需要\n518\t    minor numerical corrections 和新数据的 integration。5 个需要 update 的 claims 都是 additive（加入\n519\t    Few-NERD 和 rank=8 新数据），不是 corrective。\n520\t  tables:\n521\t  - name: audit_summary\n522\t    columns:\n523\t    - section\n524\t    - claims_checked\n525\t    - contradictions\n526\t    - updates_needed\n527\t    - status\n528\t    rows:\n529\t    - - Abstract\n530\t      - 8\n531\t      - 1\n532\t      - 2\n533\t      - minor updates\n534\t    - - Introduction\n535\t      - 6\n536\t      - 1\n537\t      - 1\n538\t      - minor updates\n539\t    - - Methods\n540\t      - 5\n541\t      - 0\n542\t      - 0\n543\t      - clean\n544\t    - - Results NER\n545\t      - 12\n546\t      - 0\n547\t      - 1\n548\t      - add Few-NERD\n549\t    - - Results RE\n550\t      - 8\n551\t      - 0\n552\t      - 0\n553\t      - clean\n554\t    - - Discussion\n555\t      - 5\n556\t      - 1\n557\t      - 1\n558\t      - disambiguation\n559\t    - - Limitations\n560\t      - 3\n561\t      - 0\n562\t      - 0\n563\t      - clean\n564\t  figures_description: []\n565\t  analysis: 审计确认所有 primary claims 在数值上 sound。3 个 contradiction 都是 reporting ambiguity（同一\n566\t    metric 在不同 dataset/condition 下的值被混淆引用），不影响 claim validity。修复后 paper 的 numerical\n567\t    integrity 完全 self-consistent。新增 Few-NERD + rank=8 数据 strengthen 而非 weaken existing\n568\t    claims。\n569\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"806625a1-4285-4bea-b47f-2ce42ec65c53","uuid":"8e378367-c3ea-4294-8321-f4b1caedca6c","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:05:50.967Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T092241/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 原始 4-layer framing 完全成立。Capability trap 作为 genuinely novel insight\n  经 3 个 NER 数据集 + scale ablation + LoRA ablation 三重验证。Headline 不需调整：'T=0 greedy dominates\n  all multi-sample strategies — the better the model, the less TTS helps.' 两个 failure\n  mechanisms 是 universal，不是 dataset-specific。Claims 强度维持 'structurally inevitable'。直接冲\n  EMNLP Main Conference。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: fewnerd_smoke\n  plan_id: exp-020\n  description: Few-NERD INTRA (coarse 8-type) 1-epoch LoRA smoke test + 200 instance\n    N=8 pilot。验证 data pipeline 和 model learnability，为 exp-021 full run 提供 gate signal。\n  expected_results:\n    greedy_f1: 0.821\n    oracle_f1: 0.892\n    oracle_headroom_pp: 7.1\n    parse_rate: 1.0\n    train_loss_1epoch: 0.142\n    eval_loss_1epoch: 0.118\n    pilot_n_instances: 200\n    pilot_sj_rho_full: 0.38\n    pilot_fk_rho_full: 0.31\n    sample_f1_pct_zero: 5.2\n    gate_pass: true\n  result_rationale: Few-NERD INTRA coarse 8-type 是中等难度 NER（比 CoNLL 的 4-type 更细但比 SciERC\n    的 domain-specific 更容易）。Qwen3-8B 在 1-epoch 内即可学到主要 pattern（参照 ft_001 和 ft_002_v2\n    的 learning curve）。8-type 分类任务的 greedy F1 预期在 0.80-0.85 之间：比 CoNLL (0.91) 低因为 type\n    更多 disambiguation 更难，比 SciERC (0.66) 高因为 Few-NERD 训练集大 (60k+ sentences) 且 entity\n    type 是通用的。Parse rate 100% 因 fine-tuned model 已学会 JSON format（参照 exp_freeform_ablation\n    99.95%）。200 instance pilot 的 SJ rho 略低于 full-set 预期值因 sample size variance。\n  tables:\n  - name: smoke_test_gate_metrics\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - pass_threshold\n    - status\n    rows:\n    - - greedy_f1\n      - 0.821\n      - '>0.60'\n      - PASS\n    - - parse_rate\n      - 1.0\n      - '>0.95'\n      - PASS\n    - - sample_f1_pct_zero\n      - 5.2\n      - <30%\n      - PASS\n    - - sj_rho_full\n      - 0.38\n      - '>0.20'\n      - PASS\n    - - train_convergence\n      - 'yes'\n      - loss decreasing\n      - PASS\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Training loss curve: 1-epoch smooth descent from ~0.5 to 0.142, confirming model\n    learns task'\n  analysis: 'Smoke test 通过所有 gate criteria。greedy F1=0.821 确认 Few-NERD INTRA 对 Qwen3-8B\n    是中等偏易任务（difficulty spectrum: WNUT < SciERC < Few-NERD < CoNLL）。低 zero-F1 rate\n    (5.2%) 预示 degeneracy 不会被 knowledge-gap 主导。可以 proceed to full run。'\n- name: fewnerd_full\n  plan_id: exp-021\n  description: Few-NERD INTRA 3-epoch LoRA fine-tune + N=8 full test set inference\n    (3 seeds)。第 3 个 NER 数据集验证 capability trap 和 selection failure 的 universality。\n  expected_results:\n    greedy_f1: 0.842\n    oracle_f1: 0.908\n    oracle_headroom_pp: 6.6\n    n_instances: 5385\n    n_valid: 4812\n    n_gold_empty_filtered: 573\n    degeneracy_rate: 0.45\n    degeneracy_rate_ci95:\n    - 0.43\n    - 0.47\n    sj_rho_full: 0.41\n    fk_rho_full: 0.36\n    logprob_rho_full: 0.28\n    em_rho_full: 0.39\n    voting_conf_rho_full: 0.43\n    sj_auroc_full: 0.78\n    fk_auroc_full: 0.72\n    logprob_auroc_full: 0.71\n    em_auroc_full: 0.8\n    voting_conf_auroc_full: 0.77\n    selection_f1_greedy: 0.842\n    selection_f1_sj: 0.839\n    selection_f1_fk: 0.838\n    selection_f1_logprob: 0.84\n    selection_f1_voting: 0.836\n    selection_f1_random: 0.828\n    selection_f1_oracle: 0.908\n    selection_gap_best_minus_greedy_pp: -0.2\n    lp_range_median_nats: 0.028\n    lp_tied_fraction: 0.52\n    sj_rho_seed42: 0.415\n    sj_rho_seed123: 0.408\n    sj_rho_seed789: 0.403\n    sj_rho_3seed_mean: 0.409\n    sj_rho_3seed_sd: 0.006\n    within_instance_rho_sj: 0.612\n    capability_trap_r2_3datasets: 0.94\n  result_rationale: Few-NERD INTRA greedy F1=0.842 将其定位在 CoNLL (0.91) 和 SciERC (0.66)\n    之间偏高处。Capability trap 预测：F1 越高 → degeneracy 越高。线性插值 (0.84-0.66)/(0.91-0.66)=0.72\n    → 预测 degeneracy = 0.21 + 0.72*(0.58-0.21) = 0.48，实际取 0.45 因 Few-NERD 的 8-type\n    比 CoNLL 4-type 稍增 output diversity。Selection failure 的机制与 SciERC/CoNLL 相同：45%\n    instances degenerate → greedy 已等于 consensus output → 多 sample 无法提升。LP compression\n    更严重（median range 0.028 vs SciERC 0.041）因 higher F1 意味 model 对 Few-NERD 更确定 → logprob\n    区分度更低。QE correlation 强于 SciERC 因 lower noise floor（fewer zero-F1 instances），但\n    selection 仍然 fails 因 degeneracy 消灭了 headroom。3-seed SD=0.006 极小，确认 signal robustness。Within-instance\n    rho=0.612（高于 SciERC 0.524）— signals ARE correlated but degeneracy makes this irrelevant\n    for selection。\n  tables:\n  - name: fewnerd_qe_5signal_comparison\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - rho_full\n    - tau_full\n    - AUROC\n    - ECE\n    - rho_ci95_low\n    - rho_ci95_high\n    rows:\n    - - voting_conf\n      - 0.43\n      - 0.318\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.312\n      - 0.396\n      - 0.462\n    - - SJ\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.303\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.389\n      - 0.375\n      - 0.443\n    - - EM\n      - 0.39\n      - 0.292\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.298\n      - 0.354\n      - 0.424\n    - - FK\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.267\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.401\n      - 0.323\n      - 0.395\n    - - logprob\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.205\n      - 0.71\n      - 0.625\n      - 0.241\n      - 0.318\n  - name: fewnerd_selection_f1\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - F1\n    - delta_vs_greedy_pp\n    - p_vs_greedy\n    rows:\n    - - oracle\n      - 0.908\n      - '+6.6'\n      - '-'\n    - - greedy (T=0)\n      - 0.842\n      - '0.0'\n      - '-'\n    - - logprob\n      - 0.84\n      - '-0.2'\n      - '0.72'\n    - - SJ\n      - 0.839\n      - '-0.3'\n      - '0.65'\n    - - FK\n      - 0.838\n      - '-0.4'\n      - '0.58'\n    - - voting_conf\n      - 0.836\n      - '-0.6'\n      - '0.42'\n    - - random\n      - 0.828\n      - '-1.4'\n      - '0.003'\n  - name: capability_trap_3dataset_summary\n    columns:\n    - dataset\n    - greedy_f1\n    - degeneracy_rate\n    - oracle_headroom_pp\n    - best_selection_delta_pp\n    rows:\n    - - CoNLL-2003\n      - 0.912\n      - 0.58\n      - 4.2\n      - '+0.1'\n    - - Few-NERD\n      - 0.842\n      - 0.45\n      - 6.6\n      - '-0.2'\n    - - SciERC\n      - 0.663\n      - 0.21\n      - 13.0\n      - '+0.6'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Capability trap scatter: x=greedy_f1, y=degeneracy_rate. 3 points (CoNLL, Few-NERD,\n    SciERC) with R²=0.94 linear fit. Error bars from 3-seed bootstrap. Dashed extrapolation\n    to F1=1.0 predicts ~70% degeneracy.'\n  - 'Selection curves: F1 vs N for N=1,2,4,8 on Few-NERD. Oracle rises steeply; all\n    signals flat-line near greedy. Gap visualization.'\n  - 'LP range distribution: violin plot comparing Few-NERD (median 0.028), SciERC\n    (median 0.041), CoNLL (median 0.019). Confirms monotonic compression with capability.'\n  analysis: Few-NERD 完美填入 capability trap 的预测区间。三个关键确认：(1) degeneracy rate 0.45 落在\n    CoNLL-SciERC 之间，F1-degeneracy 单调关系 R²=0.94；(2) ALL signals fail selection（最好的\n    logprob 也比 greedy 低 0.2pp），与 SciERC/CoNLL pattern 一致；(3) LP compression 更严重（range\n    0.028 < SciERC 0.041），符合 'higher capability → more compression' 预测。Oracle headroom\n    6.6pp 说明 information EXISTS 但 no unsupervised signal 能 access it。这是第 3 个独立数据集确认\n    universal failure。\n- name: 3rd_seed_scierc\n  plan_id: exp-022\n  description: SciERC N=8 seed=789 inference（使用现有 ft_002_v2 checkpoint）。为 Fisher combined\n    p-value 提供第 3 个独立观测，收窄所有 primary claims 的 CI。\n  expected_results:\n    ner_greedy_f1: 0.661\n    ner_oracle_f1: 0.782\n    ner_headroom_pp: 12.1\n    ner_sj_rho_full: 0.368\n    ner_fk_rho_full: 0.258\n    ner_logprob_rho_full: 0.198\n    ner_em_rho_full: 0.301\n    ner_voting_conf_rho_full: 0.385\n    ner_sj_auroc: 0.698\n    ner_em_auroc: 0.755\n    re_greedy_f1: 0.415\n    re_oracle_f1: 0.589\n    re_sj_rho_full: 0.258\n    re_logprob_rho_full: 0.272\n    re_voting_conf_rho_full: 0.342\n    re_zero_f1_pct: 44.8\n    ner_sj_rho_3seed_mean: 0.363\n    ner_sj_rho_3seed_sd: 0.012\n    ner_fk_rho_3seed_mean: 0.259\n    ner_fk_rho_3seed_sd: 0.008\n    ner_logprob_rho_3seed_mean: 0.203\n    ner_logprob_rho_3seed_sd: 0.009\n    fisher_p_sj_gt_lp_ner: 0.0038\n    fisher_p_sj_gt_fk_ner: 0.0012\n    fisher_p_structural_gt_surface_ner: 0.0005\n    fisher_p_selection_null_ner: 0.42\n    ner_sj_rho_ci95_2seed:\n    - 0.293\n    - 0.439\n    ner_sj_rho_ci95_3seed:\n    - 0.312\n    - 0.414\n    ci_width_reduction_pct: 30\n    selection_f1_greedy: 0.661\n    selection_f1_logprob: 0.654\n    selection_f1_sj: 0.651\n    selection_bootstrap_p_lp_vs_greedy: 0.45\n  result_rationale: Seed=789 作为第 3 个独立观测应与前两个 seed 高度一致（基于 exp_001_seed456_v2_ner\n    的 3seed_sd=0.025 作为 upper bound，1024-token clean data 下应更低）。NER SJ rho 预期 0.36-0.38（seed\n    42=0.360, 从 exp_re_scierc_seed123 推断 seed 123≈0.370）。3-seed SD=0.012 在 [0.005,\n    0.02] 范围内。Fisher combined p-value：每个 seed 独立给出 SJ>LP 的 one-sided test p≈0.01-0.05（基于\n    n=529 和 rho difference≈0.15），3 个 seed 组合后 χ²=-2*Σln(p) 显著增大，combined p=0.0038\n    在 [0.001, 0.01] 范围。Selection 继续 fail（p=0.42 for logprob vs greedy），与前两个 seed 一致。CI\n    从 2-seed 的 ±0.073 收窄到 3-seed 的 ±0.051（~30% reduction），所有 primary claims 的 significance\n    不变。\n  tables:\n  - name: 3seed_ner_consistency\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - seed_42\n    - seed_123\n    - seed_789\n    - mean\n    - sd\n    - fisher_p_vs_LP\n    rows:\n    - - SJ\n      - 0.36\n      - 0.362\n      - 0.368\n      - 0.363\n      - 0.012\n      - 0.0038\n    - - FK\n      - 0.267\n      - 0.255\n      - 0.258\n      - 0.259\n      - 0.008\n      - 0.019\n    - - voting_conf\n      - 0.379\n      - 0.372\n      - 0.385\n      - 0.379\n      - 0.007\n      - 0.0002\n    - - EM\n      - 0.295\n      - 0.308\n      - 0.301\n      - 0.301\n      - 0.007\n      - 0.0008\n    - - logprob\n      - 0.205\n      - 0.208\n      - 0.198\n      - 0.203\n      - 0.009\n      - '-'\n  - name: 3seed_selection_null_test\n    columns:\n    - signal\n    - seed_42_delta\n    - seed_123_delta\n    - seed_789_delta\n    - fisher_p_vs_greedy\n    rows:\n    - - logprob\n      - +0.6pp\n      - +0.5pp\n      - -0.7pp\n      - 0.42\n    - - SJ\n      - +0.3pp\n      - -0.1pp\n      - -1.0pp\n      - 0.68\n    - - FK\n      - -0.2pp\n      - +0.3pp\n      - -0.8pp\n      - 0.75\n  - name: ci_narrowing_summary\n    columns:\n    - claim\n    - 2seed_ci_width\n    - 3seed_ci_width\n    - reduction_pct\n    - significance_maintained\n    rows:\n    - - SJ > LP (NER)\n      - 0.146\n      - 0.102\n      - 30%\n      - yes (p=0.004)\n    - - SJ > FK (NER)\n      - 0.128\n      - 0.089\n      - 30%\n      - yes (p=0.001)\n    - - greedy ≥ all signals\n      - '[-0.03,+0.04]'\n      - '[-0.02,+0.03]'\n      - 25%\n      - yes (all n.s.)\n    - - degeneracy rate\n      - ±4.2pp\n      - ±3.1pp\n      - 26%\n      - 'yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: 3-seed SJ rho estimates with CI, pooled estimate with narrower CI\n    highlighted'\n  - 'Fisher χ² visualization: per-seed p-values combining into strong overall evidence'\n  analysis: 第 3 个 seed 完美收窄 CI 而不改变任何 claim 的方向或 significance。关键收获：(1) Fisher combined\n    p=0.0038 for SJ>LP on NER — 从 2-seed 的 marginal (p≈0.02) 提升到 strong significance；(2)\n    selection null hypothesis 的 3-seed combined p=0.42 — 三次独立观测均无法拒绝 'greedy ≥ all\n    signals'，进一步巩固 universal failure claim；(3) SD=0.012 显示结果 highly reproducible。所有\n    primary claims 在 3-seed 后都 maintain or strengthen significance。\n- name: lora_rank8_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-023\n  description: SciERC LoRA rank=8 fine-tune + N=8 inference。测试 fine-tuning 强度是否驱动\n    degeneracy rate，验证 'capability not fine-tuning intensity' 假设。\n  expected_results:\n    train_loss: 0.095\n    eval_loss: 0.102\n    train_epochs: 5\n    greedy_f1: 0.648\n    oracle_f1: 0.772\n    oracle_headroom_pp: 12.4\n    degeneracy_rate: 0.19\n    degeneracy_rate_rank16_ref: 0.21\n    degeneracy_delta_abs_pp: 2.0\n    sj_rho_full: 0.372\n    fk_rho_full: 0.261\n    logprob_rho_full: 0.195\n    voting_conf_rho_full: 0.381\n    selection_f1_greedy: 0.648\n    selection_f1_logprob: 0.643\n    selection_f1_sj: 0.641\n    selection_gap_best_minus_greedy_pp: -0.5\n    f1_delta_vs_rank16_pp: -1.5\n    sj_rho_delta_vs_rank16: -0.012\n    selection_failure_consistent: true\n  result_rationale: LoRA rank=8 比 rank=16 参数少一半（~4M vs ~8M trainable params），但对 8B\n    base model 而言两者都是 lightweight adaptation。Fine-tune 后 greedy F1 预期略低（-1.5pp）因 capacity\n    constraint，但 degeneracy rate 几乎不变（19% vs 21%, delta=2pp < 5pp threshold）。原因：degeneracy\n    是 model capability 的函数（8B base model 的 representation power 不因 LoRA rank 8→16\n    而显著改变），而非 fine-tuning 精度的函数。8B model 在 SciERC NER 上的 'intrinsic difficulty'（哪些\n    instances 容易/难）由 pretrained weights 决定，LoRA 只微调 task-specific mapping。QE correlations\n    也几乎不变（delta <0.02）因为 signal effectiveness 由 output distribution 特征决定，not adapter\n    capacity。Selection 继续 fail，与 rank=16 一致。这证明 capability trap 是 base model capability\n    的结构性产物，不是 fine-tuning recipe 的 artifact。\n  tables:\n  - name: lora_rank_comparison\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - rank_8\n    - rank_16\n    - delta\n    - within_5pp\n    rows:\n    - - greedy_f1\n      - 0.648\n      - 0.663\n      - -1.5pp\n      - 'yes'\n    - - degeneracy_rate\n      - 0.19\n      - 0.21\n      - -2.0pp\n      - yes (KEY)\n    - - oracle_headroom\n      - 12.4pp\n      - 13.0pp\n      - -0.6pp\n      - 'yes'\n    - - SJ rho_full\n      - 0.372\n      - 0.36\n      - +1.2pp\n      - 'yes'\n    - - LP rho_full\n      - 0.195\n      - 0.205\n      - -1.0pp\n      - 'yes'\n    - - selection_best_minus_greedy\n      - -0.5pp\n      - +0.6pp\n      - -1.1pp\n      - 'yes'\n  - name: degeneracy_driver_evidence\n    columns:\n    - evidence_type\n    - observation\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - rank 8 vs 16 (same base)\n      - Δdegen=2pp\n      - fine-tuning intensity NOT driver\n    - - 8B vs 4B (same rank=16)\n      - Δdegen=10.6pp (21% vs 10.4%)\n      - base model capability IS driver\n    - - cross-dataset (same model)\n      - Δdegen=37pp (CoNLL vs SciERC)\n      - task difficulty IS driver\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: degeneracy rate comparison across {rank=8, rank=16} × {SciERC, CoNLL}.\n    Error bars from bootstrap. rank 差异 negligible vs dataset 差异。'\n  - 'Scatter: greedy_f1 vs degeneracy_rate with rank=8 point overlaid on existing\n    rank=16 data. rank=8 点几乎落在 rank=16 的 regression line 上。'\n  analysis: LoRA rank=8 ablation 提供了 clean evidence：degeneracy delta=2pp (well within\n    5pp threshold) 而 base model capacity delta (8B vs 4B) 给出 10.6pp。这构成 2:10.6 的对比，排除了\n    'fine-tuning overfitting causes output convergence' 的 alternative explanation。Paper\n    可以写：'Halving LoRA capacity changes degeneracy by 2pp; halving base model parameters\n    changes it by 11pp — confirming that the capability trap is driven by pretrained\n    model capability, not fine-tuning intensity.' Selection 在 rank=8 同样 fail，进一步证明\n    universal 性质。\n- name: claim_audit\n  plan_id: exp-024\n  description: 系统性数值一致性审计。交叉验证 Discussion/Limitations/Abstract/Introduction 中所有 quantitative\n    claims 与源实验数据的一致性。解决已知 contradiction。\n  expected_results:\n    contradictions_found: 3\n    contradictions_resolved: 3\n    claims_verified: 47\n    claims_requiring_update: 5\n    contradiction_1: 'Discussion ''+0.1pp over single-sample'' vs Limitations ''+0.4pp\n      over greedy'' — resolved: Discussion refers to CoNLL (logprob +0.09pp), Limitations\n      refers to SciERC NER (logprob +0.6pp). Unified to dataset-specific reporting.'\n    contradiction_2: 'Abstract ''AUROC up to 0.82'' vs Results EM AUROC=0.749 — resolved:\n      0.82 refers to CoNLL EM AUROC=0.816 (from exp_002). Update Abstract to cite\n      dataset.'\n    contradiction_3: 'Intro ''ρ up to 0.45'' vs max observed SJ ρ=0.436 on CoNLL —\n      resolved: 0.45 is rounded from CoNLL SJ cond ρ=0.451. Change to ''ρ up to 0.45\n      (conditional)'' or use exact value.'\n    update_1: 'Section 4.2: change ''greedy F1=0.664'' to ''greedy F1=0.663'' (1024-token\n      corrected value)'\n    update_2: 'Table 3: add Few-NERD column with new degeneracy data'\n    update_3: 'Section 5.1: update Fisher p from 2-seed to 3-seed value'\n    update_4: 'Section 5.3: add rank=8 ablation row to Table 5'\n    update_5: 'Abstract: update ''2 NER datasets'' to ''3 NER datasets'''\n    all_primary_claims_valid: true\n  result_rationale: Numerical contradictions 典型来自 iterative writing process 中不同 section\n    引用不同实验版本的数据（512-token vs 1024-token, N=8 vs N=16, conditional vs full）。在 best\n    tier 下，所有 contradiction 都是 superficial reporting errors 而非 substantive claim failures。审计后所有\n    primary claims（capability trap, selection failure, two mechanisms）保持 valid，只需要\n    minor numerical corrections 和新数据的 integration。5 个需要 update 的 claims 都是 additive（加入\n    Few-NERD 和 rank=8 新数据），不是 corrective。\n  tables:\n  - name: audit_summary\n    columns:\n    - section\n    - claims_checked\n    - contradictions\n    - updates_needed\n    - status\n    rows:\n    - - Abstract\n      - 8\n      - 1\n      - 2\n      - minor updates\n    - - Introduction\n      - 6\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - minor updates\n    - - Methods\n      - 5\n      - 0\n      - 0\n      - clean\n    - - Results NER\n      - 12\n      - 0\n      - 1\n      - add Few-NERD\n    - - Results RE\n      - 8\n      - 0\n      - 0\n      - clean\n    - - Discussion\n      - 5\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - disambiguation\n    - - Limitations\n      - 3\n      - 0\n      - 0\n      - clean\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 审计确认所有 primary claims 在数值上 sound。3 个 contradiction 都是 reporting ambiguity（同一\n    metric 在不同 dataset/condition 下的值被混淆引用），不影响 claim validity。修复后 paper 的 numerical\n    integrity 完全 self-consistent。新增 Few-NERD + rank=8 数据 strengthen 而非 weaken existing\n    claims。\n","numLines":569,"startLine":1,"totalLines":569}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YPV4hbtYb4Zzurb5F3dgM7","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"EMNLP 2026 reviewer guidelines review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"FAQ - EMNLP 2026\",\"url\":\"https://2026.emnlp.org/faq/\"},{\"title\":\"LINGUIST List 37.972 Confs: 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (Hungary)\",\"url\":\"https://linguistlist.org/issues/37/972/\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2026 : The 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in N\",\"url\":\"https://callforpaper.org/call-for-papers-emnlp-2026\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2026 | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP%2F2026\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP\"},{\"title\":\"Authors Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/authors\"},{\"title\":\"Changes to reviewer volunteering requirement and incentives in May 2025 cycle (EMNLP 2025)\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2025\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2025 (@emnlpmeeting) · X\",\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/emnlpmeeting\"},{\"title\":\"EMNLP 2026 (@emnlpmeeting) / Posts / X\",\"url\":\"https://x.com/emnlpmeeting\"},{\"title\":\"[EMNLP 2025] First Call for Papers | ACL Member Portal\",\"url\":\"https://www.aclweb.org/portal/content/emnlp-2025-first-call-papers\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about EMNLP 2026, though the specific reviewer guidelines and review form were not directly available in the search results. Here's what I found:\n\n## EMNLP 2026 Review Process\n\nEMNLP 2026 will use ACL Rolling Review (ARR) as a reviewing system, but final decisions will be made by the conference. Both submissions of articles for review and commitment of reviewed articles to the conference will be performed via the Open Review platform, with authors following a two-step process: submitting articles to ARR where they receive reviews and meta-reviews, then committing their reviewed articles to EMNLP 2026 where Senior Area Chairs and Program Chairs make acceptance decisions.\n\n## Important Dates for Reviewers\n\nIf you receive assignments, your reviews must be completed by July 6, or your meta-reviews by July 29.\n\n## Key Requirements\n\nYou are encouraged to have a look at the submission form and responsible NLP checklist, which list all the questions you will be asked during submission.\n\nFor the specific reviewer guidelines and review form templates, you may need to visit the [EMNLP 2026 official website](https://2026.emnlp.org/) or the [ACL Rolling Review site](http://aclrollingreview.org/) directly, as these detailed documents were not included in the search results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"806625a1-4285-4bea-b47f-2ce42ec65c53","uuid":"a97566e6-e634-4959-8b38-25cfab7a08bd","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:05:56.234Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"EMNLP 2026 reviewer guidelines review form","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01JGsZirsUdjxuaFdYR7QAhY","content":[{"title":"FAQ - EMNLP 2026","url":"https://2026.emnlp.org/faq/"},{"title":"LINGUIST List 37.972 Confs: 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing (Hungary)","url":"https://linguistlist.org/issues/37/972/"},{"title":"EMNLP 2026 : The 2026 Conference on Empirical Methods in N","url":"https://callforpaper.org/call-for-papers-emnlp-2026"},{"title":"EMNLP 2026 | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP%2F2026"},{"title":"EMNLP | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=EMNLP"},{"title":"Authors Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/authors"},{"title":"Changes to reviewer volunteering requirement and incentives in May 2025 cycle (EMNLP 2025)","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/incentives2025"},{"title":"EMNLP 2025 (@emnlpmeeting) · X","url":"https://twitter.com/emnlpmeeting"},{"title":"EMNLP 2026 (@emnlpmeeting) / Posts / X","url":"https://x.com/emnlpmeeting"},{"title":"[EMNLP 2025] First Call for Papers | ACL Member Portal","url":"https://www.aclweb.org/portal/content/emnlp-2025-first-call-papers"}]},"Based on the search results, I found information about EMNLP 2026, though the specific reviewer guidelines and review form were not directly available in the search results. Here's what I found:\n\n## EMNLP 2026 Review Process\n\nEMNLP 2026 will use ACL Rolling Review (ARR) as a reviewing system, but final decisions will be made by the conference. Both submissions of articles for review and commitment of reviewed articles to the conference will be performed via the Open Review platform, with authors following a two-step process: submitting articles to ARR where they receive reviews and meta-reviews, then committing their reviewed articles to EMNLP 2026 where Senior Area Chairs and Program Chairs make acceptance decisions.\n\n## Important Dates for Reviewers\n\nIf you receive assignments, your reviews must be completed by July 6, or your meta-reviews by July 29.\n\n## Key Requirements\n\nYou are encouraged to have a look at the submission form and responsible NLP checklist, which list all the questions you will be asked during submission.\n\nFor the specific reviewer guidelines and review form templates, you may need to visit the [EMNLP 2026 official website](https://2026.emnlp.org/) or the [ACL Rolling Review site](http://aclrollingreview.org/) directly, as these detailed documents were not included in the search results."],"durationSeconds":5.929025071}}
