{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018zFtbzFVfgEMAzMLQcK4Sg","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_vc_lp_cascade_selection** (killed): VC-filtered LP selection cascade: test if combining VC (pre-filter) + LP (rank) improves selection F1 over single-signal selection. Addresses SF3 reviewer suggestion. Pure analysis on existing data.\\\\n- **exp_tacred_re_benchmark** (killed): TACRED RE benchmark: replicate SciERC RE experiment flow on second RE dataset. Verify correlation-selection gap generalizes beyond SciERC. D104 highest priority — addresses R11 MF1 consensus weakness.\\\\n- **exp_entity_token_lp** (negative): Entity-token LP: test Discussion hypothesis (d) format-token dilution. Re-inference with per-token logprobs, then compute entity-only LP variance and selection F1. If entity-token LP compression is reduced → pilot remedy for LP selection. Also includes LP z-score normalization as zero-cost baseline. Addresses SF2+SF3 from Round 12.\\\\n  [exp_entity_token_lp_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/exp_entity_token_lp/data/results.json) | [exp_entity_token_lp_report](/api/workspace-files/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/artifacts/exp_entity_token_lp/report/report.md)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 61 / 负向 24 / 失败 4 / 共 111\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nautodl-5090: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- ft_002: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_pilot_002: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_007_ner_llama: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp001_seed123: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp001_seed456: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp008_re_n16: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_002_merg