{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012bEM7CacLu2DiySambX5Vq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 原始 4-layer framing 完全成立。Capability trap 作为 genuinely novel insight\n2\t  经 3 个 NER 数据集 + scale ablation + LoRA ablation 三重验证。Headline 不需调整：'T=0 greedy dominates\n3\t  all multi-sample strategies — the better the model, the less TTS helps.' 两个 failure\n4\t  mechanisms 是 universal，不是 dataset-specific。Claims 强度维持 'structurally inevitable'。直接冲\n5\t  EMNLP Main Conference。\n6\timagined_experiments:\n7\t- name: fewnerd_smoke\n8\t  plan_id: exp-020\n9\t  description: Few-NERD INTRA (coarse 8-type) 1-epoch LoRA smoke test + 200 instance\n10\t    N=8 pilot。验证 data pipeline 和 model learnability，为 exp-021 full run 提供 gate signal。\n11\t  expected_results:\n12\t    greedy_f1: 0.821\n13\t    oracle_f1: 0.892\n14\t    oracle_headroom_pp: 7.1\n15\t    parse_rate: 1.0\n16\t    train_loss_1epoch: 0.142\n17\t    eval_loss_1epoch: 0.118\n18\t    pilot_n_instances: 200\n19\t    pilot_sj_rho_full: 0.38\n20\t    pilot_fk_rho_full: 0.31\n21\t    sample_f1_pct_zero: 5.2\n22\t    gate_pass: true\n23\t  result_rationale: Few-NERD INTRA coarse 8-type 是中等难度 NER（比 CoNLL 的 4-type 更细但比 SciERC\n24\t    的 domain-specific 更容易）。Qwen3-8B 在 1-epoch 内即可学到主要 pattern（参照 ft_001 和 ft_002_v2\n25\t    的 learning curve）。8-type 分类任务的 greedy F1 预期在 0.80-0.85 之间：比 CoNLL (0.91) 低因为 type\n26\t    更多 disambiguation 更难，比 SciERC (0.66) 高因为 Few-NERD 训练集大 (60k+ sentences) 且 entity\n27\t    type 是通用的。Parse rate 100% 因 fine-tuned model 已学会 JSON format（参照 exp_freeform_ablation\n28\t    99.95%）。200 instance pilot 的 SJ rho 略低于 full-set 预期值因 sample size variance。\n29\t  tables:\n30\t  - name: smoke_test_gate_metrics\n31\t    columns:\n32\t    - metric\n33\t    - value\n34\t    - pass_threshold\n35\t    - status\n36\t    rows:\n37\t    - - greedy_f1\n38\t      - 0.821\n39\t      - '>0.60'\n40\t      - PASS\n41\t    - - parse_rate\n42\t      - 1.0\n43\t      - '>0.95'\n44\t      - PASS\n45\t    - - sample_f1_pct_zero\n46\t      - 5.2\n47\t      - <30%\n48\t      - PASS\n49\t    - - sj_rho_full\n50\t      - 0.38\n51\t      - '>0.20'\n52\t      - PASS\n53\t    - - train_convergence\n54\t      - 'yes'\n55\t      - loss decreasing\n56\t      - PASS\n57\t  figures_description:\n58\t  - 'Training loss curve: 1-epoch smooth descent from ~0.5 to 0.142, confirming model\n59\t    learns task'\n60\t  analysis: 'Smoke test 通过所有 gate criteria。greedy F1=0.821 确认 Few-NERD INTRA 对 Qwen3-8B\n61\t    是中等偏易任务（difficulty spectrum: WNUT < SciERC < Few-NERD < CoNLL）。低 zero-F1 rate\n62\t    (5.2%) 预示 degeneracy 不会被 knowledge-gap 主导。可以 proceed to full run。'\n63\t- name: fewnerd_full\n64\t  plan_id: exp-021\n65\t  description: Few-NERD INTRA 3-epoch LoRA fine-tune + N=8 full test set inference\n66\t    (3 seeds)。第 3 个 NER 数据集验证 capability trap 和 selection failure 的 universality。\n67\t  expected_results:\n68\t    greedy_f1: 0.842\n69\t    oracle_f1: 0.908\n70\t    oracle_headroom_pp: 6.6\n71\t    n_instances: 5385\n72\t    n_valid: 4812\n73\t    n_gold_empty_filtered: 573\n74\t    degeneracy_rate: 0.45\n75\t    degeneracy_rate_ci95:\n76\t    - 0.43\n77\t    - 0.47\n78\t    sj_rho_full: 0.41\n79\t    fk_rho_full: 0.36\n80\t    logprob_rho_full: 0.28\n81\t    em_rho_full: 0.39\n82\t    voting_conf_rho_full: 0.43\n83\t    sj_auroc_full: 0.78\n84\t    fk_auroc_full: 0.72\n85\t    logprob_auroc_full: 0.71\n86\t    em_auroc_full: 0.8\n87\t    voting_conf_auroc_full: 0.77\n88\t    selection_f1_greedy: 0.842\n89\t    selection_f1_sj: 0.839\n90\t    selection_f1_fk: 0.838\n91\t    selection_f1_logprob: 0.84\n92\t    selection_f1_voting: 0.836\n93\t    selection_f1_random: 0.828\n94\t    selection_f1_oracle: 0.908\n95\t    selection_gap_best_minus_greedy_pp: -0.2\n96\t    lp_range_median_nats: 0.028\n97\t    lp_tied_fraction: 0.52\n98\t    sj_rho_seed42: 0.415\n99\t    sj_rho_seed123: 0.408\n100\t    sj_rho_seed789: 0.403\n101\t    sj_rho_3seed_mean: 0.409\n102\t    sj_rho_3seed_sd: 0.006\n103\t    within_instance_rho_sj: 0.612\n104\t    capability_trap_r2_3datasets: 0.94\n105\t  result_rationale: Few-NERD INTRA greedy F1=0.842 将其定位在 CoNLL (0.91) 和 SciERC (0.66)\n106\t    之间偏高处。Capability trap 预测：F1 越高 → degeneracy 越高。线性插值 (0.84-0.66)/(0.91-0.66)=0.72\n107\t    → 预测 degeneracy = 0.21 + 0.72*(0.58-0.21) = 0.48，实际取 0.45 因 Few-NERD 的 8-type\n108\t    比 CoNLL 4-type 稍增 output diversity。Selection failure 的机制与 SciERC/CoNLL 相同：45%\n109\t    instances degenerate → greedy 已等于 consensus output → 多 sample 无法提升。LP compression\n110\t    更严重（median range 0.028 vs SciERC 0.041）因 higher F1 意味 model 对 Few-NERD 更确定 → logprob\n111\t    区分度更低。QE correlation 强于 SciERC 因 lower noise floor（fewer zero-F1 instances），但\n112\t    selection 仍然 fails 因 degeneracy 消灭了 headroom。3-seed SD=0.006 极小，确认 signal robustness。Within-instance\n113\t    rho=0.612（高于 SciERC 0.524）— signals ARE correlated but degeneracy makes this irrelevant\n114\t    for selection。\n115\t  tables:\n116\t  - name: fewnerd_qe_5signal_comparison\n117\t    columns:\n118\t    - signal\n119\t    - rho_full\n120\t    - tau_full\n121\t    - AUROC\n122\t    - ECE\n123\t    - rho_ci95_low\n124\t    - rho_ci95_high\n125\t    rows:\n126\t    - - voting_conf\n127\t      - 0.43\n128\t      - 0.318\n129\t      - 0.77\n130\t      - 0.312\n131\t      - 0.396\n132\t      - 0.462\n133\t    - - SJ\n134\t      - 0.41\n135\t      - 0.303\n136\t      - 0.78\n137\t      - 0.389\n138\t      - 0.375\n139\t      - 0.443\n140\t    - - EM\n141\t      - 0.39\n142\t      - 0.292\n143\t      - 0.8\n144\t      - 0.298\n145\t      - 0.354\n146\t      - 0.424\n147\t    - - FK\n148\t      - 0.36\n149\t      - 0.267\n150\t      - 0.72\n151\t      - 0.401\n152\t      - 0.323\n153\t      - 0.395\n154\t    - - logprob\n155\t      - 0.28\n156\t      - 0.205\n157\t      - 0.71\n158\t      - 0.625\n159\t      - 0.241\n160\t      - 0.318\n161\t  - name: fewnerd_selection_f1\n162\t    columns:\n163\t    - method\n164\t    - F1\n165\t    - delta_vs_greedy_pp\n166\t    - p_vs_greedy\n167\t    rows:\n168\t    - - oracle\n169\t      - 0.908\n170\t      - '+6.6'\n171\t      - '-'\n172\t    - - greedy (T=0)\n173\t      - 0.842\n174\t      - '0.0'\n175\t      - '-'\n176\t    - - logprob\n177\t      - 0.84\n178\t      - '-0.2'\n179\t      - '0.72'\n180\t    - - SJ\n181\t      - 0.839\n182\t      - '-0.3'\n183\t      - '0.65'\n184\t    - - FK\n185\t      - 0.838\n186\t      - '-0.4'\n187\t      - '0.58'\n188\t    - - voting_conf\n189\t      - 0.836\n190\t      - '-0.6'\n191\t      - '0.42'\n192\t    - - random\n193\t      - 0.828\n194\t      - '-1.4'\n195\t      - '0.003'\n196\t  - name: capability_trap_3dataset_summary\n197\t    columns:\n198\t    - dataset\n199\t    - greedy_f1\n200\t    - degeneracy_rate\n201\t    - oracle_headroom_pp\n202\t    - best_selection_delta_pp\n203\t    rows:\n204\t    - - CoNLL-2003\n205\t      - 0.912\n206\t      - 0.58\n207\t      - 4.2\n208\t      - '+0.1'\n209\t    - - Few-NERD\n210\t      - 0.842\n211\t      - 0.45\n212\t      - 6.6\n213\t      - '-0.2'\n214\t    - - SciERC\n215\t      - 0.663\n216\t      - 0.21\n217\t      - 13.0\n218\t      - '+0.6'\n219\t  figures_description:\n220\t  - 'Capability trap scatter: x=greedy_f1, y=degeneracy_rate. 3 points (CoNLL, Few-NERD,\n221\t    SciERC) with R²=0.94 linear fit. Error bars from 3-seed bootstrap. Dashed extrapolation\n222\t    to F1=1.0 predicts ~70% degeneracy.'\n223\t  - 'Selection curves: F1 vs N for N=1,2,4,8 on Few-NERD. Oracle rises steeply; all\n224\t    signals flat-line near greedy. Gap visualization.'\n225\t  - 'LP range distribution: violin plot comparing Few-NERD (median 0.028), SciERC\n226\t    (median 0.041), CoNLL (median 0.019). Confirms monotonic compression with capability.'\n227\t  analysis: Few-NERD 完美填入 capability trap 的预测区间。三个关键确认：(1) degeneracy rate 0.45 落在\n228\t    CoNLL-SciERC 之间，F1-degeneracy 单调关系 R²=0.94；(2) ALL signals fail selection（最好的\n229\t    logprob 也比 greedy 低 0.2pp），与 SciERC/CoNLL pattern 一致；(3) LP compression 更严重（range\n230\t    0.028 < SciERC 0.041），符合 'higher capability → more compression' 预测。Oracle headroom\n231\t    6.6pp 说明 information EXISTS 但 no unsupervised signal 能 access it。这是第 3 个独立数据集确认\n232\t    universal failure。\n233\t- name: 3rd_seed_scierc\n234\t  plan_id: exp-022\n235\t  description: SciERC N=8 seed=789 inference（使用现有 ft_002_v2 checkpoint）。为 Fisher combined\n236\t    p-value 提供第 3 个独立观测，收窄所有 primary claims 的 CI。\n237\t  expected_results:\n238\t    ner_greedy_f1: 0.661\n239\t    ner_oracle_f1: 0.782\n240\t    ner_headroom_pp: 12.1\n241\t    ner_sj_rho_full: 0.368\n242\t    ner_fk_rho_full: 0.258\n243\t    ner_logprob_rho_full: 0.198\n244\t    ner_em_rho_full: 0.301\n245\t    ner_voting_conf_rho_full: 0.385\n246\t    ner_sj_auroc: 0.698\n247\t    ner_em_auroc: 0.755\n248\t    re_greedy_f1: 0.415\n249\t    re_oracle_f1: 0.589\n250\t    re_sj_rho_full: 0.258\n251\t    re_logprob_rho_full: 0.272\n252\t    re_voting_conf_rho_full: 0.342\n253\t    re_zero_f1_pct: 44.8\n254\t    ner_sj_rho_3seed_mean: 0.363\n255\t    ner_sj_rho_3seed_sd: 0.012\n256\t    ner_fk_rho_3seed_mean: 0.259\n257\t    ner_fk_rho_3seed_sd: 0.008\n258\t    ner_logprob_rho_3seed_mean: 0.203\n259\t    ner_logprob_rho_3seed_sd: 0.009\n260\t    fisher_p_sj_gt_lp_ner: 0.0038\n261\t    fisher_p_sj_gt_fk_ner: 0.0012\n262\t    fisher_p_structural_gt_surface_ner: 0.0005\n263\t    fisher_p_selection_null_ner: 0.42\n264\t    ner_sj_rho_ci95_2seed:\n265\t    - 0.293\n266\t    - 0.439\n267\t    ner_sj_rho_ci95_3seed:\n268\t    - 0.312\n269\t    - 0.414\n270\t    ci_width_reduction_pct: 30\n271\t    selection_f1_greedy: 0.661\n272\t    selection_f1_logprob: 0.654\n273\t    selection_f1_sj: 0.651\n274\t    selection_bootstrap_p_lp_vs_greedy: 0.45\n275\t  result_rationale: Seed=789 作为第 3 个独立观测应与前两个 seed 高度一致（基于 exp_001_seed456_v2_ner\n276\t    的 3seed_sd=0.025 作为 upper bound，1024-token clean data 下应更低）。NER SJ rho 预期 0.36-0.38（seed\n277\t    42=0.360, 从 exp_re_scierc_seed123 推断 