     - clean\n554\t    - - Discussion\n555\t      - 5\n556\t      - 1\n557\t      - 1\n558\t      - disambiguation\n559\t    - - Limitations\n560\t      - 3\n561\t      - 0\n562\t      - 0\n563\t      - clean\n564\t  figures_description: []\n565\t  analysis: 审计确认所有 primary claims 在数值上 sound。3 个 contradiction 都是 reporting ambiguity（同一\n566\t    metric 在不同 dataset/condition 下的值被混淆引用），不影响 claim validity。修复后 paper 的 numerical\n567\t    integrity 完全 self-consistent。新增 Few-NERD + rank=8 数据 strengthen 而非 weaken existing\n568\t    claims。\n569\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015GqB64KFqf8Hak3CP21zMo","session_id":"806625a1-4285-4bea-b47f-2ce42ec65c53","uuid":"d8eb031e-7011-456c-b335-c13fd2adc4c3","timestamp":"2026-05-16T10:08:28.336Z"}
